    <p><% $c->i18n->p("barcode.mason.to_start_select_a_data_source_and_a_data_level", "To start, select a data source and a data level. The data source can be a list, crossing experiment, trial, or genotyping plate. When you are finished, click 'Next'.") |h %><p>
